# Facts on file

- `arm-eval/judge.mjs` scores a model answer as `conformant: false` when its output does not parse against the requested schema; under `CLAUDE_BACKEND=cli` a judge call that passed `system` was seen scoring its own transport failure that way.
- `claude -p --bare` (which skips auto-discovery of project context) returns "Not logged in · Please run /login" on this machine: it strips the OAuth credit together with the prefix.
- The auto-discovered context prefix of `claude -p` in this repo is ~164,000 tokens on every call.
